      "reviewer": "research review",
      "searchCoverage": "Official AroFlo help (Site Admin > AroFlo API) and apidocs.aroflo.com document HMAC-SHA512 against https://api.aroflo.com/ (no /v2). Pinned OpenConnector uses Bearer against https://api.aroflo.com/v2 and cites docs.api.aroflo.com/guides/authentication/. The Developer Hub at docs.api.aroflo.com exists as a JS site but did not yield a verifiable Bearer/v2 endpoint spec on 2026-09-13. HMAC signing is an unsupported native request semantic. Company identity (Melbourne, Australia / Simpro Group) and dated incident search (AroFlo + security breach/incident) reviewed on 2026-09-13. No qualifying current unresolved AroFlo platform compromise found; this is not a breach-free claim.",
